==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} Light, having a [[mixture]] of [[frequencies]], being [[perceive]]d as having no [[specific]] [[colour]]; such as [[sunlight]].
# {{lb|en|countable}} A white-coloured [[light]] or [[lamp]]
# {{lb|en|euphemistic|as '''''the white light'''''}} The believed entrance to the [[afterlife]], as occasionally reported of [[near-death experience]]s.

